Copyright (c) 2026 Alex Alhaddad. Licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

see-plan is an independent re-implementation of the core review loop of
lavish-axi (https://github.com/kunchenguid/lavish-axi), Copyright (c) 2026
Kun Chen, MIT License. It reuses lavish-axi's public API names for
compatibility (window.lavish, data-lavish-action, data-lavish-question).

No source files were copied or adapted from lavish-axi. This was checked on
2026-11-01 by comparing public/sdk.js and src/guidance.js against upstream
src/artifact-sdk.js and src/playbooks.js: they share no lines.

lavish-axi's license follows.

